{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 15, "text": "对庆祝国庆的指示（一九六七年九月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n349)\n对庆祝国庆的指示\n（一九六七年九月）\n今年的国庆要充分的宣传文化大革命的成就。\n×　　　×　　　×\n游行不单是游行，也是大批判。用文艺武器批判党内最大的走资本主义道路当权派。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-ef5af7200275ba7ed9f0", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-349.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "07397d25c9fdd83b613de8a9b6236a38e88abdaf7eafe8d270a31ff22bb61b07", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "ffb0f25e9416ad0eed0879cdbd60ea3308a997cc8306b788e5cfef926998f891", "text_chars": 159}
